      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقَدَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>root</i> of the tongue; (O, K;) as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَكَدَةٌ</span> [q. v.]; (O;) i. e. the <i>thick part</i> thereof.
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also n. un. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقَدٌ</span> as applied to sand.
(S, O, L, K. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقِدٌ</span>.])

